# 🐍 Flask Web Application

This is a simple Python Flask web application used for demonstrating Docker containerization and AWS ECS deployment through Jenkins CI/CD.

---

## Features

- Flask Web Server
- Dockerized Application
- Production Ready
- ECS Compatible

---

## Technologies

- Python
- Flask
- Docker

---

## Run Locally

Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run

```bash
python app.py
```

---

## Docker

Build Image

```bash
docker build -t flask-app .
```

Run Container

```bash
docker run -d -p 5000:5000 flask-app
```

---

## Folder Structure

```
app/

Dockerfile

app.py

requirements.txt

templates/
```
